  "content": "[![](https://i.slabfi.sh/web/slabfish_plush.png)](https://slabfi.sh/makeship)\n\n![](https://i.slabfi.sh/banner/upgrade_aquatic.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/blueprint\"><img alt=\"蓝图\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/blueprint\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh\"><img alt=\"网站\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/website\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/discord\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/x\"><img alt=\"X（原推特）\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/x\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/patreon\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/patreon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### 📖 关于：\n《水域升级》模组的重点是改进《水域更新》中添加的内容，包括海洋、河流和失眠机制。我们的目标是在保持《我的世界》原版风格的同时，提供独特的内容、视觉效果和玩法。一些显著特色包括：鞭笞者——一种类似鲨鱼的幻想生物，使用声纳定位，能撕咬捕捉到的任何猎物，并掉落用于合成三叉戟的材料；通过砂岩下方的气泡柱实现可再生沙子；以及生成海晶珊瑚和鹦鹉螺生物的海洋峡谷！\n\n![](https://i.slabfi.sh/web/divider.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/blueprint\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/blueprint.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/abnormals_delight\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/abnormals_delight.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/allurement\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/allurement.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/atmospheric\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/atmospheric.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/autumnity\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/autumnity.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/berry_good\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/berry_good.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/boatload\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/boatload.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/buzzier_bees\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/buzzier_bees.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/caverns_and_chasms\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/caverns_and_chasms.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/clayworks\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/clayworks.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/endergetic\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/endergetic.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/environmental\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/environmental.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/gallery\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/gallery.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/incubation\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/incubation.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/neapolitan\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/neapolitan.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/personality\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/personality.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/pet_cemetery\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/pet_cemetery.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/savage_and_ravage\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/savage_and_ravage.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/upgrade_aquatic\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/upgrade_aquatic.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/woodworks\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/woodworks.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n</p>\n\n![](https://i.slabfi.sh/web/divider.png)\n\n[![](https://i.slabfi.sh/web/nodecraft.png)](https://slabfi.sh/nodecraft)",
